    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lumiose is hardly short on cafés, as I’m sure\nyou’ve seen. The competition is fierce!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s why we’re creating a new menu item to\nhelp us stand out. And what we’ve landed on is...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pansage! Pansear! And Panpour!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061006E00730061006700650021002000500061006E0073006500610072002100200041006E0064002000500061006E0070006F00750072002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "These three similar-seeming Pokémon have some\nrather exciting and unique traits, you see.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The leaves on Pansage’s head can relieve fatigue!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800650020006C006500610076006500730020006F006E002000500061006E00730061006700652019007300200068006500610064002000630061006E002000720065006C006900650076006500200066006100740069006700750065002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The tuft on Pansear’s head contains a flame that\nburns at around 600 degrees Fahrenheit!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And the water stored in the tuft on Panpour’s\nhead is packed full of nutrients!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In short: revitalizing leaves, nutrient-rich water,\nand flames at an ideal temperature, yes?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If we combine each of these Pokémon’s special\ntraits, we should achieve the perfect cup of tea!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please, could you catch these three Pokémon so I\ncan briefly borrow their services?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In return, I’ll treat you to the very first cup of the\nperfect tea we’ll make!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pansage, Pansear, and Panpour love high places,\nlike the trees you find lining the roads of the city.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAdd all three to your party and bring them here,\nthen I’ll do the rest.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 181
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ohoho! You brought a Pansage, a Pansear, and a\nPanpour—just as I requested!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you so much! I’ll get right to making the\ntea, so do take a seat and settle in.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for your patience!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B00200079006F007500200066006F007200200079006F00750072002000700061007400690065006E00630065002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m happy to report that with the aid of Pansage,\nPansear, and Panpour, I’ve created...Pantrio Tea!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI thought about calling it Pansagesearpour Tea,\nbut that’s rather a mouthful...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 187
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And now, dear customer, please enjoy a cup of\nour special new brew...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00640020006E006F0077002C0020006400650061007200200063007500730074006F006D00650072002C00200070006C006500610073006500200065006E006A006F00790020006100200063007500700020006F0066000A006F007500720020007300700065006300690061006C0020006E0065007700200062007200650077002E002E002E00100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well...? What did you think? The fragrance, taste,\nand nutritional value are all top-notch, no?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah! But I mustn’t forget to return your dear\nPokémon to you.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006800210020004200750074002000490020006D007500730074006E2019007400200066006F007200670065007400200074006F002000720065007400750072006E00200079006F0075007200200064006500610072000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200074006F00200079006F0075002E00100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
